t(35, 60, """'What is their entirety?' He said: 'With their shepherds and their dogs'."

Explaining the narration and the meaning:
The form of the wording:
The report came in the form of telling of an unseen event that will happen at the end of time, when whole Arab tribes will take refuge in joining the lands of the Romans (fleeing to them).
Exaggeration in the flight: the phrase "with their shepherds and their dogs" (and in other narrations: "with their sheep and their dogs") is a figurative Arab expression meaning total departure and complete flight; that is, the tribe will move with everything it owns, even the simple things usually not paid attention to such as dogs and shepherds, so they leave nothing behind them.

And in another narration in Nu'aym: "Tribes of the Arabs will surely join the Romans with their sheep and their dogs."

And in another narration in Nu'aym: "How will you be when the fitnahs wrap around you, until tribes of the Arabs join the Romans in their entirety, leaving behind them neither a hobble nor a tick."

The hobble and the tick: another Arab expression indicating uprooting and total departure (the hobble is the camel's rope, and the tick is a small insect that clings to animals).

Where the Arab will flee with "his sheep" (the source of his livelihood and food) and "his dog" (which guards the sheep), which means emptying his land completely, settling in the lands of the Romans and taking everything with him!

The sum of these narrations conveys tribes of the Arabs joining the Romans in their entirety at the end of time, when the parties, music, dancing and all that is available today in what they call coastal parties will all be available in some regions of Europe for the rich who will be angry at that time, as those regions in Europe will attract them because of their money and millions, which will be in the form of movables: gold, silver, ships and other in-kind, non-cash possessions. It seems that this file will be a file of conflict between two nations over everyone who flees to the two sides, and Allah knows best, and it seems this file will be very heated at that time, as there are two competing nations at that time:
🟢 A nation that attracts from the Romans to win their hearts for a great heavenly goal, in addition to the Sunnah of mutual repelling on earth in industry, building and development
🔴 And a nation that continues to open the door of migration for the same reasons as today: the facade of human rights, the claims of protecting the human being, and also to attract the money of the rich because of poverty after a destructive war, and to spite the other nation!""")

