t(36, 540, """Or proof of success from Allah the Exalted! The Tatar armies were like ants! The armies of Hitler and Stalin were in millions! The armies of tyrannical empires were in millions! Female dancers and performers are followed by millions, not even thousands!

By Allah, I have not found anyone more foolish than those who walked in the way of the ancients, about whom the Lord of Might said:
In His saying, the Exalted: "And Ad and Thamud, and it has become clear to you from their dwellings. And Satan made their deeds attractive to them and averted them from the path, while they were endowed with perception".

The meaning of the verse:
And Satan made their deeds attractive to them: Iblis made disbelief and sins look good to them and showed them in a fine form. So he averted them from the path: this adornment prevented them from the path of truth and faith in Allah. And they were endowed with perception: that is, they were intelligent, possessing insight and the ability to discern, but they were pleased with their misguidance and thought they were upon guidance and right while they were upon falsehood, and Allah's proof was not hidden from them.""")

h(36, 1300, """At the end of the journey of the digital age, there was none more foolish than a misguided one whose followers are in millions, who thought that the multitude is proof of the right path!""")

t(36, 1880, """“While they both call on Allah for help: Woe to you, believe!” You see them on social media, and you see them in their homes, with their families and households, hypnotised, having done it to themselves for money and fame, and in homes for selfish pleasure and the love of oppression. So you say: Woe to you, you may die upon this; woe to you, wake up in alarm .. Woe to you, look at the path you are walking on; do you not see the devils on both sides of the path with their horns and fangs, encouraging you and laughing so that you keep walking? They do not hear the voice .. they do not hear the call .. they do not hear the warner .. they do not hear the voice of the Hereafter that has begun to echo in souls .. They have slept!""")

h(36, 2400, """Self-love sets off hypnosis in the soul, so you see the sinner or the oppressor asleep, and you try to wake him, but he never responds, and you say, as in:""")

t(37, 500, """So you will see around the world foolish acts done by humans who would not have done them before. They are evil works whose aim is to break the nose of society and make society as a whole feel inferior, and make even those who do not do the same acts feel internal defeat. Suppose a righteous father's son became corrupt among people; was the one who practised corruption the father? The truth is that the one who practised corruption is the son, but the father has come to walk among people crowned with shame, head bowed, defeated from within. And the same is true in the corruption of individuals who are part of society; they are the sons of society, and society as a whole is a father, and this collective father will feel shame every day, because those who practise foolishness and stupidity are from it by lineage, not by a broad nationality, and there is no longer an Ummah-hood that has an effect on feeling the strength of the bond of lineage in the states of the world today. Today every people boasts of the sons of its lineage, not of the Ummah-hood that gathers them as an Ummah, and that is why shame is felt today as lineage and belonging. If shame were still felt as Ummah-hood and the community of one Ummah, the matter would be different. So bringing down groups of humans today who belong to the collective component by lineage and clan is a crushing psychological blow to the collective component, making all of it feel shame and disgrace, so it relapses, shakes, weakens and falls apart!""")

h(37, 1200, """In the cunning of the wicked: if you want to defeat a virtuous society, make part of it foolish cattle""")

