t(41, 1070, """Even the prophets, peace and blessings be upon them, pray to Allah the Most Great to admit them into the class of His righteous servants. So the basis among the two accountable species (humans and jinn) is the class of righteousness, which is the comprehensive class. As for prophethood and the message, they are an exceptional class due to the necessity of special duty on earth, and the exception always returns to the root of the more comprehensive general class, which is righteousness.""")

