t(46, 60, """… so its inhabitants have repelled one another for thousands of years like magnets that do not calm down and do not cooperate. When the moment of regulating the whole world comes, the Middle East is regulated first, and its inhabitants come under a rule that does not oppress but does not joke with them even once, so this East is regulated in a sudden, unexpected, fast and awe-inspiring way, and then its role in disciplining begins. Here is where the messages came down, not to make an iPhone but to regulate the soul of the world.""")

