t(46, 1105, """2 billion humans in this Ummah speak at the same time, all of them give their opinions on monotheism, Sharia and the unseen, all of them are scholars of religion, all of them issue fatwas in religion and publish fatwas through their phone screens!

And 99% of what they do is nothing but making noise; they only make noise and say what they do not understand. When I was asked 4 years ago what is good for this Ummah, I said, and I will not change what I said: a dictator who is merciful to this Ummah, because the last chapters of the ruin of this Ummah, so that it vanishes completely and disappears, is what is happening now: every phone holder gives his opinion, then admires his opinion, then fights for his opinion, and in 90% of cases you will find his opinion to be nothing but a mistake in the making of his mind!""")

